## 4. Comprehensive Actor Catalog

| Actor Name | Type | Description & Responsibilities |
|---|---|---|
| **Passenger / Rider** | Primary (Human) | Books rides, selects inclusive ride modes (Normal, Pink, PWD, Elderly, Premium), enters addresses, monitors live trip, provides security PIN to driver, triggers SOS, rates rides. |
| **Pink Mode Passenger** | Primary (Specialization) | Female riders or accompanied women requiring verified female drivers and enhanced safety protocols. Subject to solo male policy guard. |
| **PWD Passenger** | Primary (Specialization) | Passengers with physical disabilities requiring wheelchair-accessible vehicles (WAV) and accessible frontend interfaces. |
| **Elderly Passenger** | Primary (Specialization) | Senior citizens utilizing large-typography UX and automated caregiver check-in notifications. |
| **Co-Passenger (Split)** | Primary (Specialization) | Secondary rider who joins an ongoing compatible trip along the same corridor for discounted fares and eco-friendly ride-sharing. |
| **Driver** | Primary (Human) | Applies for onboarding, uploads KYC docs, goes online/offline, accepts rides, verifies passenger 4-digit PIN, navigates routes, reports policy violations, completes trips. |
| **Admin / Safety Dispatcher** | Primary (Human) | Oversees live vehicle fleet radar, reviews driver KYC submissions, triages and resolves SOS incidents, manages master fleet online switches, audits platform metrics. |
| **Guest / Public User** | Primary (Human) | Unauthenticated user exploring the app, using Indian cities geocoding, exploring safety guides, or triggering emergency public SOS. |
| **Scikit-Learn ML Engines** | Secondary (External System) | Embedded AI services: (1) Random Forest Safety Classifier classifying route risk into `Stable`, `Cautious`, or `High Priority`; (2) Random Forest Surge Regressor predicting dynamic multipliers (`1.0x` to `2.2x`). |
| **Twilio Emergency Gateway** | Secondary (External System) | Telecommunications API responsible for sending automated high-priority emergency SMS alerts and synthetic voice phone calls to emergency contacts, admins, and police. |
| **Cloudinary Storage Service** | Secondary (External System) | Cloud media storage managing driver driving licenses, vehicle registrations, NBI clearances, and medical certificates. |
| **Indian Cities Geo Engine & OSRM** | Secondary (External System) | Geocoding service indexing 4,231 Indian cities and calculating OpenStreetMap turn-by-turn routes and polylines. |
| **National Police / 112 Authorities** | Secondary (External System) | Public emergency services escalated during high-severity threat incidents. |
| **Browser Speech AI Engine** | Secondary (System Primitive) | Web Speech API speech-to-text engine enabling hands-free voice commands. |

